Student Marks Calculator (Python)
Project Description
This is a simple Python project designed for 12th standard level students.
The program takes marks of 5 subjects as input, calculates total marks, percentage, and assigns a grade based on performance.

Features:

Input student name

Input marks for 5 subjects

Calculate total marks

Calculate percentage

Assign grade (A+, A, B, C, Fail)

Display final result

---Concepts Used---

Python variables

Input & Output

Arithmetic operations

Conditional statements (if-elif-else)

